WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:01.720
Hello I'm a citizen.

00:00:01.720 --> 00:00:03.220
And I'm the government.

00:00:03.220 --> 00:00:08.380
We've put a special tax on tobacco products to discourage smoking.

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:14.360
Oh okay. Because it's expensive to take care of smokers so your dis-incentivizing us from smoking?

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:20.960
Right. Also, we put a special tax on drinking alcohol because that's a problem.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.160
Alright.

00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:28.640
Also we're taxing your income.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.280
Kay.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.500
Hello I'm a citizen.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:32.920
And I'm the government.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:35.520
I bet you can't stop being a hypocrite for one minute.

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:42.340
You know I'd take that bet but gambling is illegal.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:45.800
Hello I'm a citizen.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:47.300
And I'm the government.

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:50.000
I just got paid today and you took a lot of my money.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:57.680
About that—I will slowly start giving you some of that money back if and when you reach age 67.

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:06.660
What happens if I don't make it to age 67?

